# Sealed days live on the orphan `ledger` branch, never on main. The README's local commands
# write them here (`seal-daily --ledger-dir ledger`, the seal workflow's `ledger-wt` worktree)
# and the painting commands write a forecast and its strip; none of it is ever committed.
# Anchored to the repo root, like data/, so no package directory is ignored by accident.
/ledger/
/ledger-wt/
/forecast.json
/strip.png

